{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>The secret things belong to HaShem our Elohim.</b> Even though I said that you are all standing before HaShem — that no man can mislead Him and He will exact retribution from the traitor — this will apply to the secret things alone." "<b>And the revealed things belong to us and to our children forever.</b> But in the revealed things, the matter is imposed upon us and upon our children, and it is fitting for us to act upon all the words of this Torah — to punish the sinners and to carry out upon them the written judgment."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:32.874088623Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}